OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786110488
OL,3,CMan accused of Belfast knife attack
OL,4,Curged to seek legal representation
OL,6,FA man accused of a knife attack which
OL,7,Fsparked rioting in Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fhas been urged by a judge to seek
OL,9,Flegal representation.
OL,11,FHadi Alodid, 30, of Duncairn Avenue in
OL,12,FBelfast, appeared before Belfast
OL,13,FMagistrates' Court by videolink on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,16,FHe was told that a preliminary inquiry
OL,17,Fwould be held in his case next month.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/5
