PN,41902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786110488
OL,3,CMan accused of Belfast knife attack
OL,4,Curged to seek legal representation
OL,6,FAlodid is charged with the attempted
OL,7,Fmurder of Stephen Ogilvie on June 8,
OL,8,Fwho the court previously heard lost
OL,9,Fhis left eye and received deep cuts to
OL,10,Fhis head, face and back.
OL,12,FThe incident in north Belfast sparked
OL,13,Fserious disorder in several areas
OL,14,Facross Northern Ireland, which police
OL,15,Fhave said was racially motivated.
OL,17,FThe rioting saw masked mobs set fire
OL,18,Fto homes, cars and a bus, with people
OL,19,Ftargeted based on their race.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
