FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786110488
OL,3,CMan accused of Belfast knife attack
OL,4,Curged to seek legal representation
OL,6,FForeign national healthcare workers
OL,7,Fwere also subjected to threats and
OL,8,Fintimidation.
OL,10,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,11,Fhas previously said that Alodid may
OL,12,Foriginally be from Chad.
OL,14,FHe has also been charged with
OL,15,Fthreatening to kill an NHS
OL,16,Fradiographer and with possession of a
OL,17,Fknife.
OL,19,FOn Wednesday, Alodid appeared in court
OL,20,Fby a link from Maghaberry Prison,
OL,21,Fwhere he is on remand.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/5
