PN,41904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786110488
OL,3,CMan accused of Belfast knife attack
OL,4,Curged to seek legal representation
OL,6,FDistrict Judge Anne Marshall was told
OL,7,Fthat a preliminary inquiry in the case
OL,8,Fwas to be fixed for September 23, with
OL,9,Fa review before then on September 2.
OL,11,FA preliminary inquiry is the procedure
OL,12,Fby which a case is moved from the
OL,13,Fmagistrates' court to the crown court.
OL,15,FThe judge asked an Arabic interpreter
OL,16,Fto inform Alodid of the dates for his
OL,17,Fhearings next month.
OL,19,FThe judge said: "I would suggest that
OL,20,Fhe gets a solicitor."
