OL,3,CMan accused of Belfast knife attack
OL,4,Curged to seek legal representation
OL,6,FWhen asked through the interpreter if
OL,7,Fhe wanted to say anything, Alodid
OL,8,Fsaid: "No comment."
OL,10,FHe will appear in court next on
OL,11,FSeptember 2.
